\u2019s the next player\u2019s chance to spin the spinner!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1455630/extras/3adbc8c1eca073272de85ed5e3d7282c.poster.avif?t=1753108261\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1455630/extras/3adbc8c1eca073272de85ed5e3d7282c.webm?t=1753108261\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1455630/extras/3adbc8c1eca073272de85ed5e3d7282c.mp4?t=1753108261\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div>Choose between the pink, blue or the purple peg. Select an outfit and make your peg your own. Browse a selection of cars, bikes and scooters and find a ride to suit your style.  </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"> </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1455630/extras/44fefa5f5fd57197e287446d6ecf4912.poster.avif?t=1753108261\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1455630/extras/44fefa5f5fd57197e287446d6ecf4912.webm?t=1753108261\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1455630/extras/44fefa5f5fd57197e287446d6ecf4912.mp4?t=1753108261\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div>Unlock new outfits and vehicles by playing the game and earning rewards! </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1455630/extras/cdcf7d177fbdbda5eae43fe312ac00ab.poster.avif?t=1753108261\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1455630/extras/cdcf7d177fbdbda5eae43fe312ac00ab.webm?t=1753108261\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1455630/extras/cdcf7d177fbdbda5eae43fe312ac00ab.mp4?t=1753108261\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div>Live life in enchanted worlds! Every new world features new outfits, vehicles, jobs, properties and more! Buy worlds separately in-game, or buy the Ultimate Life Collection to unlock them all!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1455630/extras/aab903e1a721013632f925f068ede74a.poster.avif?t=1753108261\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1455630/extras/aab903e1a721013632f925f068ede74a.webm?t=1753108261\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1455630/extras/aab903e1a721013632f925f068ede74a.mp4?t=1753108261\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div>Join your friends and family, whether they\u2019re on PlayStation 4, PlayStation 5, Xbox, PC (Steam), Nintendo Switch, iOS or Android.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Live every life you\u2019ve ever dreamed of in The Game of Life 2 \u2013 play today!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"> </p>",
